    "title": "Cora Sue Forbes - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Leesburg-News.com Obituaries ,\n21 hours ago Cora Sue Forbes, age 81, passed away on June 21, 2026, in Altoona, Florida, leaving behind a tapestry of love and memories that will be cherished by all who knew her. Born on August 24, 1944, in Aberdeen, South Dakota, Sue made a lasting impact in her community and in the hearts of her family. Read full article",
